Device powers on
      ↓
ESP32 starts reading:
  - Accelerometer (continuous)
  - Pulse sensor (continuous)
  - Button state (interrupt-based)
      ↓
Any trigger fires? (fall / abnormal pulse / button press)
      ↓
YES →
  1. GPS module fetches current coordinates
  2. SIM800L sends SMS to 3 saved emergency numbers:
     "ALERT: [Name] needs help! Location: maps.google.com/?q=LAT,LONG"
  3. SIM800L auto-dials the first emergency contact
  4. If ESP32 is connected to WiFi → also pushes alert to Firebase
      ↓
NO → keep monitoring in loop
